<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>QWC Remastered: third-party licences</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; line-height: 1.4; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f1ea; padding: 1em; font-size: 0.85em; }
  li { margin: 0.1em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>QWC Remastered is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (the file LICENSE).
It is built with the Rust crates below, each under its own licence. The fonts' licences (SIL Open Font License) are
beside them in remastered/fonts/.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}  <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
